WEBVTT

00:26:59.621 --> 00:27:03.163
This is quality, we've been talking
about being patient and obstinate

00:27:03.163 --> 00:27:07.413
and resilient. I imagine that came in
handy early in your career when people

00:27:07.413 --> 00:27:10.538
are telling you you can't do this
work without a doctorate and

00:27:10.538 --> 00:27:12.329
a woman can't do this work anyway.

00:27:12.621 --> 00:27:14.454
Can you talk to me a little bit
about how you dealt with

00:27:14.454 --> 00:27:16.496
the criticism from closed minded men?

00:27:17.788 --> 00:27:20.829
Well, you know, honestly,
people always say that.

00:27:20.829 --> 00:27:24.746
But I didn't have that kind of
criticism any more, I think,

00:27:24.746 --> 00:27:29.204
than if I'd been a male. I was criticized
for giving the chimpanzees names,

00:27:29.746 --> 00:27:34.996
but I guess that criticism would have come
even if I'd been a male student,